  "description": "Shared test vectors of the PBI reference matcher (plan 02 §2; GitStation I1b, kanflow K1). Both sides must produce `refs` for `text`. Rule: /(?<![a-z0-9])pbi[-_ ]?#?(\\d{1,7})(?![0-9])/gi with ASCII-only case folding (as JavaScript without the u flag); a reference is `PBI-` + the number as a decimal integer (leading zeros dropped); `refs` lists distinct references in the order of their first match. Matching resumes after the end of a match; the look-behind reads the character before the candidate in the original text.",
